    "Boring Notch can show all your upcoming events in one place. Access to your calendar is needed to display your schedule.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "工位充电岛 can show all your upcoming events in one place. Access to your calendar is needed to display your schedule."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "工位充电岛可以集中展示即将开始的日程。显示日程需要访问你的日历。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Boring Notch can show your scheduled reminders alongside your calendar events. Access to Reminders is needed to display your reminders.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "工位充电岛 can show your scheduled reminders alongside your calendar events. Access to Reminders is needed to display your reminders."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "工位充电岛可以在日历旁显示已安排的提醒事项。显示提醒需要访问你的提醒事项。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Boring Notch includes a mirror feature that lets you quickly check your appearance using your camera, right from the notch. Camera access is required only to show this live preview. You can turn the mirror feature on or off at any time in the app.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "工位充电岛 includes a mirror feature that lets you quickly check your appearance using your camera, right from the notch. Camera access is required only to show this live preview. You can turn the mirror feature on or off at any time in the app."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "工位充电岛的镜子功能可通过摄像头在刘海下方显示实时预览。摄像头仅用于此预览，你可以随时关闭镜子。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
