    "鼠标停留在物理刘海区域，展开小岛与日常工具。短休息的计时和小树成长保存在本机。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hover over the physical notch to open your island and daily tools. Rest timers and sweet potato stock stay on this Mac."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "鼠标停留在物理刘海区域，展开小岛与日常工具。短休息的计时和小树成长保存在本机。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "鼠标停留在物理刘海区域，展开薯队长与日常工具。红薯钟、休息进度和红薯库存保存在本机。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hover over the physical notch to open Captain Shu and daily tools. The Sweet Potato Timer, rest progress, and sweet potato stock stay on this Mac."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "鼠标停留在物理刘海区域，展开薯队长与日常工具。红薯钟、休息进度和红薯库存保存在本机。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "鼠标在摄像头所占用的刘海区域停留 150 毫秒后展开，两侧的状态展示不触发展开。无刘海屏幕使用顶部模拟胶囊。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hover over the physical camera notch for 150 milliseconds to open the island. Status areas on either side do not trigger it. Displays without a notch use a capsule at the top."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "鼠标在摄像头所占用的刘海区域停留 150 毫秒后展开，两侧的状态展示不触发展开。无刘海屏幕使用顶部模拟胶囊。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
