            "value": "Off hides both the icon and the remaining time, and the notch keeps its normal width. The session itself keeps running and still settles on time."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关闭后计时期间不再显示图标和剩余时间，刘海保持正常宽度。计时本身照常进行，也照常按时结算。"
          }
