    "已设为拖出后一律移除，组合键不再起作用。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Set to always remove after dragging, so the chord has no effect."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已设为拖出后一律移除，组合键不再起作用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "开启后会定期检查剪贴板类型，仅在其中确有图片时才读取内容，用于接住其它截图工具的图片。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Periodically checks what type the clipboard holds and reads the contents only when it really is an image, so screenshots from other tools land here too."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开启后会定期检查剪贴板类型，仅在其中确有图片时才读取内容，用于接住其它截图工具的图片。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "拖出前或拖动途中按住该组合键即可，放手时松没松开都算。拖回小岛不会移除；移除后 10 秒内可撤销。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hold the chord before or during the drag; releasing it first is fine. Dropping back on the island never removes, and a removal can be undone for 10 seconds."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "拖出前或拖动途中按住该组合键即可，放手时松没松开都算。拖回小岛不会移除；移除后 10 秒内可撤销。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "提高延迟可以避免鼠标划过边缘就误收起。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A longer delay stops the island collapsing when the pointer just brushes its edge."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "提高延迟可以避免鼠标划过边缘就误收起。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "每个文件从进入暂存区起单独计时。截图、录屏、剪贴板图片，以及去背景、转格式、合成 PDF、压缩生成的文件都会被真正删除；只有从访达拖进来、仍能定位到原文件的条目才是到期只移除条目，磁盘上的原件不动。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each file ages from the moment it was staged. Screenshots, recordings, clipboard images and anything this app generates for you — background removal, format conversion, PDF and zip output — are deleted for real; only items dragged in from Finder that still resolve to their original file just lose the shelf entry, leaving that original untouched."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每个文件从进入暂存区起单独计时。截图、录屏、剪贴板图片，以及去背景、转格式、合成 PDF、压缩生成的文件都会被真正删除；只有从访达拖进来、仍能定位到原文件的条目才是到期只移除条目，磁盘上的原件不动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
