    "Save whatever was copied by hi, WeChat, Finder or another app to the shelf, keeping the original file format.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Save whatever was copied by hi, WeChat, Finder or another app to the shelf, keeping the original file format."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "把 hi、微信、访达或其它应用复制的内容存入暂存区，保持原有文件格式。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "播放时在专辑封面周围叠一层随封面取色的柔光。此前叫「封面背后模糊」，但那个效果从未被绘制，名字与实际不符。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lays a soft glow, tinted from the artwork, around the album art while playing. This was previously labelled “blur behind album art”, but that effect was never drawn — the name did not match what happened."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "播放时在专辑封面周围叠一层随封面取色的柔光。此前叫「封面背后模糊」，但那个效果从未被绘制，名字与实际不符。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "开启后会定期检查剪贴板类型，仅在其中确有图片时才读取内容，用于接住其它截图工具的图片。复制文件时剪贴板里也会有该文件的图标位图，这种情况交给「暂存剪贴板文件」按钮按原格式复制，自动接收不会把图标当成图片存进来。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Polls the clipboard's declared types and reads the contents only when a picture is genuinely there, so screenshots from other tools land here too. Copying a file also puts that file's icon on the clipboard; those are left to the “save clipboard files” button, which copies the real bytes, so the watcher never mistakes an icon for a picture."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开启后会定期检查剪贴板类型，仅在其中确有图片时才读取内容，用于接住其它截图工具的图片。复制文件时剪贴板里也会有该文件的图标位图，这种情况交给「暂存剪贴板文件」按钮按原格式复制，自动接收不会把图标当成图片存进来。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "指针停在暂存区上时可用 ⌘C 复制、⌘X 剪切、⌘V 粘贴；右键菜单里也有同样的命令。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "While the pointer is over the shelf, ⌘C copies, ⌘X cuts and ⌘V pastes. The same commands are in the right-click menu."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "指针停在暂存区上时可用 ⌘C 复制、⌘X 剪切、⌘V 粘贴；右键菜单里也有同样的命令。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "右键菜单可复制 / 剪切 / 粘贴。⌘C / ⌘X / ⌘V 需要辅助功能权限（小岛不抢键盘焦点，只能靠事件监听读到组合键），未授权时快捷键不生效，右键菜单不受影响。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Copy, cut and paste are in the right-click menu. ⌘C / ⌘X / ⌘V additionally need accessibility access — the island never takes keyboard focus, so a key chord can only be seen through an event monitor. Without that access the shortcuts do nothing; the menu is unaffected."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "右键菜单可复制 / 剪切 / 粘贴。⌘C / ⌘X / ⌘V 需要辅助功能权限（小岛不抢键盘焦点，只能靠事件监听读到组合键），未授权时快捷键不生效，右键菜单不受影响。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mirror desktop notifications from any app. Task completion is shown only when the source app actually posts a notification; task state is never guessed.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mirror desktop notifications from any app. Task completion is shown only when the source app actually posts a notification; task state is never guessed."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "转显任意 App 的桌面通知。只有来源 App 真的发出通知时才会显示任务完成，绝不猜测任务状态。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS notification permission": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS notification permission"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 通知权限"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An app must be allowed to post notifications in System Settings first. If that master switch is off, neither the island nor the top-right corner shows anything, and no setting here can change that.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "An app must be allowed to post notifications in System Settings first. If that master switch is off, neither the island nor the top-right corner shows anything, and no setting here can change that."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "App 必须先在「系统设置 → 通知」里被允许发送通知。那个总开关不开，小岛和屏幕右上角都不会有任何提醒，这里的任何设置都无法改变。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS does not let this app read those permissions, so the state shown here cannot reflect them.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS does not let this app read those permissions, so the state shown here cannot reflect them."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 不允许本 App 读取那份权限设置，所以这里显示的状态无法反映它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open system notification settings": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open system notification settings"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开系统通知设置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Default for new apps": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Default for new apps"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "新 App 的默认行为"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mirror notifications from apps you have not configured": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mirror notifications from apps you have not configured"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "转显尚未配置过的 App 的通知"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show previews for apps you have not configured": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Show previews for apps you have not configured"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "为尚未配置过的 App 显示内容预览"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apps appear below after they post their first notification. Turning one off here always overrides the defaults above.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apps appear below after they post their first notification. Turning one off here always overrides the defaults above."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "App 会在发出第一条通知后自动出现在下方。在下面单独关闭某个 App，总是优先于上面的默认行为。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apps seen so far": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apps seen so far"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已出现过的 App"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No app has posted a notification yet. The first one to arrive shows up here.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No app has posted a notification yet. The first one to arrive shows up here."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "还没有任何 App 发过通知。第一条通知到达后，对应的 App 就会出现在这里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "App": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
